#: scenario8:scenario8_5F88ED1F_1464_46E6_9A85_A320528C2618
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57fa4c61f9121d9579fa937ec473df02f1baec3a0cc4c9c180c91b70e1f63ef5
